From u00ebeb6e0521112d at groups.google.com  Wed Feb 15 13:18:11 2023
From: u00ebeb6e0521112d at groups.google.com (Marc Kery)
Date: Wed, 15 Feb 2023 13:18:11 +0000
Subject: AW: [unmarked] Re: Usage of occu() vs. colext()
